# {{title}}

An [AGBoss](https://github.com/agbossjs/agboss) project, generated by `agboss create`.

```bash
cp .env.example .env    # your OPENROUTER_API_KEY
npm run chat            # talk to the {{kebab}}-workflow
npm run describe        # the application: its workflows, agents, tools and settings
npm run check           # types, lint and tests
```

Add parts — every name is the full one, the same as in `name`:

```bash
npx agboss generate agent billing-agent --workflow {{kebab}}-workflow
npx agboss generate tool refund-tool --workflow {{kebab}}-workflow --agent billing-agent
npx agboss generate workflow onboarding-workflow   # a second workflow of the application
npx agboss help
```
